Error [E0226]: This call writes its receiver, so the mark is `&`, not `^`
  --> receiver_mark_mismatch.jet:8:5
    |
  8 |     ^buf.append(" world")
    |     ^
 Why: `&` marks a place the call writes and `^` a place the call takes; the resolved method declares which one
 Fix: Replace `^` with `&`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0226
